{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"お、はるき\r\nいい挨拶だな","trans":"哦，阳希\n问候得不错啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001000410020","name":"はるき","text":"え、ほんとですか～？","trans":"诶，真的吗～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ、だってはるきの挨拶は──","trans":"嗯，因为阳希的问候──","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001000410030","name":"はるき","text":"わぁ……！","trans":"哇……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001000410040","name":"はるき","text":"それは何よりです……！","trans":"那就再好不过了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001000410050","name":"はるき","text":"そうですかねぇ……","trans":"是这样吗……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001000410060","name":"はるき","text":"元気になれる方が\r\nいいんじゃないでしょうか……？","trans":"能让人打起精神的\n不是更好吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001000410070","name":"はるき","text":"ふぅん……？","trans":"嗯……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001000410080","name":"はるき","text":"まさか、怖いってことでしょうか……","trans":"难道说，是觉得可怕吗……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}